\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Fine-tuned endpoints. LoRA learning rate $3.53{\times }10^{-4}$, full FT $2{\times }10^{-5}$; batch 128; seed 316; training stops when validation loss stops improving (eps/k rule). Exact match $=$ 0-shot accuracy on 1,024 held-out problems. The 4M file is the 1M file plus 3M new unique problems, disjoint from every evaluation set. ``Converged'' teach FT continues the 2-pass run from its checkpoint until the rule fires (optimizer state restarted).}}{2}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:endpoints}{{2}{2}{Fine-tuned endpoints. LoRA learning rate $3.53{\times }10^{-4}$, full FT $2{\times }10^{-5}$; batch 128; seed 316; training stops when validation loss stops improving (eps/k rule). Exact match $=$ 0-shot accuracy on 1,024 held-out problems. The 4M file is the 1M file plus 3M new unique problems, disjoint from every evaluation set. ``Converged'' teach FT continues the 2-pass run from its checkpoint until the rule fires (optimizer state restarted)}{table.2}{}}
